{
  "key": 60499,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you listen to the radio?\r",
        "Which shows do you prefer?\r",
        "I like Buena’s Password!\r",
        "When I catch it, I take notes so\n",
        "I don’t forget the password.\r",
        "That’s why my Pokégear is full\n",
        "of scribbles!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Even Team Rocket would understand\n",
        "how refreshing it is to listen to the\f",
        "Radio on the rooftop, right?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "If you’re tired, try the Vending\n",
        "Machine’s drinks.\f",
        "Your Pokémon will love them, too."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Team Rocket...\r",
        "You should have a drink from the\n",
        "vending machine and take a break.\r",
        "It’s about time you started thinking\n",
        "of how you want to live your life."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Take a Break from Shopping!\n",
        "6F Rooftop Atrium"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s a vending machine.\n",
        "Which drink would you like? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Clang!\r",
        "A can of {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0} dropped down.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Clang!\r",
        "Bonus! Another can of {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}\n",
        "dropped down.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00008",
      "en_US": "Not enough money..."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00009",
      "en_US": "Decided not to buy a drink."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "The must-try of the Goldenrod\n",
        "Department Store!\f",
        "Welcome to the Daily Drawing Corner!\r",
        "You can try it for $300, and we have\n",
        "wonderful prizes!\r",
        "Would you like to try it? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "All right. Please draw one!\r",
        "...\n",
        "...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Wow!\n",
        "You’ve got yourself the no. {STRVAR_1 50, 0, 0} prize!\r",
        "Please take it.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00013",
      "garbage": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00014",
      "en_US": "Oh my..."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh my...\n",
        "Your Bag is full.\r",
        "Then we’ll refund you the money.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh my...\n",
        "You’re short of money.\r",
        "Please come again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00017",
      "en_US": "Please come again."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "Sunday’s prizes will be:\r",
        "No. 1, TM02!\n",
        "No. 2, Luxury Ball!\f",
        "Or No. 3, a Berry!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "Monday’s prizes will be:\r",
        "No. 1, TM65!\n",
        "No. 2, Nest Ball!\f",
        "Or No. 3, a Berry!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "Tuesday’s prizes will be:\r",
        "No. 1, TM91!\n",
        "No. 2, Repeat Ball!\f",
        "Or No. 3, a Berry!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "Wednesday’s prizes will be:\r",
        "No. 1, TM57!\n",
        "No. 2, Net Ball!\f",
        "Or No. 3, a Berry!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00022",
      "en_US": [
        "Thursday’s prizes will be:\r",
        "No. 1, TM60!\n",
        "No. 2, Quick Ball!\f",
        "Or No. 3, a Berry!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00023",
      "en_US": [
        "Friday’s prizes will be:\r",
        "No. 1, TM42!\n",
        "No. 2, Dusk Ball!\f",
        "Or No. 3, a Berry!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00024",
      "en_US": [
        "Saturday’s prizes will be:\r",
        "No. 1, TM62!\n",
        "No. 2, Timer Ball!\f",
        "Or No. 3, a Berry!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00025",
      "en_US": [
        "Whitney: What a coincidence!\n",
        "This must be meant to be.\r",
        "Do you want to exchange\n",
        "phone numbers? Please? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00026",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} registered Whitney\n",
        "in the Pokégear!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00027",
      "en_US": [
        "Whitney: I’m available around noon\n",
        "on Saturdays.\r",
        "Give me a call when you’ve got time."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00028",
      "en_US": "Whitney: Don’t be so mean."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00029",
      "en_US": [
        "Whitney: Do you want to know\n",
        "my phone number now? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00030",
      "en_US": [
        "Whitney: Why don’t we take a\n",
        "picture together? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00031",
      "en_US": [
        "Whitney: OK!\n",
        "Stand right next to me, right here!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00032",
      "en_US": "Whitney: Don’t we look good together?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00033",
      "en_US": "Whitney: That’s a shame!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0597_T25R1006_00034",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Photo Album is full.\r",
        "Access your PC to delete\n",
        "some pictures."
      ]
    }
  ]
